            "faq_max_height": 400,
            "faq1_question": "How many times should I use this?",
            "faq1_answer": "<p>Use this product once daily in the evening. Start with 2-3 times per week and gradually increase frequency as your skin builds tolerance.</p>",
            "faq2_question": "I already use an exfoliating scrub, should I continue with that after I use this cleanser?",
            "faq2_answer": "<p>It's recommended to avoid using other exfoliating products when starting this treatment to prevent over-exfoliation.</p>",
            "faq3_question": "Will this make me break out?",
            "faq3_answer": "<p>Some initial purging may occur as your skin adjusts. This is normal and should subside within 2-4 weeks of consistent use.</p>",
            "faq4_question": "How long until I see results on my face?",
            "faq4_answer": "<p>Most users see visible improvements within 4-6 weeks of consistent use. Results may vary depending on skin type and condition.</p>",
            "faq5_question": "Can we use it on Acne Prone Skin?",
            "faq5_answer": "<p>Yes, this product is suitable for acne-prone skin. However, start slowly and monitor your skin's response.</p>",
            "faq6_question": "Is this good for Dry Skin?",
            "faq6_answer": "<p>Yes, but ensure you follow up with a good moisturizer as this product can be drying initially.</p>",
